      "title": "迎拜庄宗并受召",
      "summary": "梁亡，唐庄宗入汴，郭氏哭号迎拜；庄宗在杀石氏之后召她，她害怕而听命。",
      "year": 923,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "year",
      "sourceDate": "梁亡、唐庄宗入汴后；未独记召见日",
      "phase": "fall",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v010",
          "paragraphId": "old-v010-p34",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "9e06e55cddb7de8b321e82f078a54990f4b1216c6a2146776e6de5dcd9daa3cc",
          "excerpt": "唐帝入宮，妃郭氏號泣迎拜。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v13",
          "paragraphId": "new-v13-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "2b96ffabc368ac3a5761313bd2bc88d41df2efaf1692a3f4d727a21dc2f764f0",
          "excerpt": "次以召妃，妃懼而聽命。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "迎拜、受召与出家分开，不把未独年月的后续全部压到入汴之日。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liang-zhu-youzhen-consort-guo-head-burial-order",
      "title": "受诏与安崇阮收葬末帝",
      "summary": "通鉴记娄继英未及葬而获罪被诛，朝廷命梁旧臣安崇阮与郭氏安葬梁均王。",
      "year": 937,
      "sortOrder": 2,
      "precision": "month",
      "sourceDate": "通鉴天福二年九月记事；无独立日干支",
      "phase": "later",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v281",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v281-p53",
